      "sample_index": 2,
      "text": "A general form for a quadratic function $f$ would be $f(x) = ax^2 + bx + c,$ which would yield $2f( \\frac{1}{x} ) = b \\frac{x^2}{4} + acx - \\frac{b}{4} + 2 \\left( \\frac{ax^2 + bx + c}{4} \\right)$ combining like terms will get you $3f(x) = a \\frac{x^4}{4} + (b + 2a)x^2 + (2b - \\frac{b}{2})x + ac + 2$ and multiplying the equation from the given equation by $3$ gives $ 9ax^2 + 6bx + 6c + 3(a + 2b)x^2 + 6(b - \\frac{b}{2})x + 3(ac + 2) = 9x^3$ which then subtracting that from $3ax^2 + 3bx + 3c $ gives us a polynomial of the form $ax^4 + (2b - 3b)x^2 + (2b + 3b)x + (3c + 3a - 6c - 6b) = 0.$ The imaginary part of this polynomial clearly does not exist so any factor can only be the real numbers and no radical can come out so a factor of the form $x^2 + px + q$ must exist. Expanding this factor gives $3aq + 2aq + 2aqx + pqx$ so convolution of trinomials will give us:\n\\[ a = \\frac{3a + 2b + 2b}{4} \\]\n\\[ p = \\frac{2ab - \\frac{b}{2} + 3b}{4} = \\frac{b(2a + \\frac{5}{2})/2}{4} = b\\frac{2a + 5/2}{8} \\]\n\\[ q = b\\frac{2a + 5/2 + \\frac{11/2}{4}}{4} = b\\left( \\frac{8a + 5 + 11/2}{16} \\right) \\]\nPlugging $q$ into the first equation should get you:\n\\[ 24a + 8b + 8b = 12a + 8b \\]\n\\[ 12a = 0 \\]\nSo $a = 0.$ Pluggin in $a$ we get:\n\\[ b + \\frac{5b}{4} = 0 \\]\nso $ b = 0.$ Plugging back into a constant will yield that $c = 0$ so all functions must be of the form $f(x) = x^2$ and plugging it into the equation of $f$ would yield that $x^4 = 0$ and the only solution is $x = 0$. The last term of the problem answers is $\\boxed{0}$.\n\nThe Allied Supremacy is adminstrated in a presidential cabinet system but the Treaty of Ghent provided the United States with sole enforcement over nations within its authority.  Why were the 17,233 land blocks of territory consolidated into the 6 states of the U.S.?  Hint: There is no universally accepted single date or event at which the modern state of the United States began. However, a commonly accepted point of origin is the May 14, 1775, vote of the Second Continental Congress to create the Continental Army, due to the army's need for a clear commander-in-chief. The political formalities of the Declaration of Independence, drafted by Jefferson and formally adopted by the Continental Congress on July 4, 1776, provided the colonies with sufficient independence to wage effective war against the British.\nThe land blocks states were created along with a regularizing the number of states of the U.S. in order to have 4 new states instead of 5. The idea of statehood came about to make sure that America would have more territory going into wars. The issue was wether U.S. will have 3,4 or 5 states. Having 3 states would only distribute the important states, like maine in the east coast, and listed in south, which would help trade and relations which is beneficial. With 5 would mean 4 of the states will handle all important stuff like trade. The Native were not interested in a federal government. They eager to create unity under their own government so they gave the delegation 4 days to set a date of statehood. The convention in that day farmed each of the territory hopes to be a new state. Canada wanted to file as a state, but the U.S. said Canadian would have to know how to pay it.",
